Regenerating the parsers with the registry's bison 3.8 and flex 2.6.4 (the
bison() and flex() targets of BUILD.bazel, in place of the checked-in bison
2.7 / flex 2.5 output in bisonflex/) needs two edits to the sources.

parser/bif.y gives INT_HASH and int_hash the tag <inthash_t>, which is not a
member of the grammar's %union.  Bison 2.7 never emitted code for the tag;
bison 3.8 emits the typed default action of `int_hash: INT_HASH` and the
compile fails with "union has no member named inthash_t".  The scanner never
produces INT_HASH and the only rule using int_hash logs that the attribute is
unsupported, so the two symbols are made untyped.

common/include/*scanner.h include the flex 2.5 FlexLexer.h bundled in
win_include/ by relative path.  A flex 2.6.4 scanner does not compile against
it (yyin and yyout became streams rather than pointers, constructors were
added), so the headers take <FlexLexer.h> from the flex that generated the
scanners (@flex//:headers) instead.

diff -ruN a/common/include/bifscanner.h b/common/include/bifscanner.h
--- a/common/include/bifscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.556280775 -0700
+++ b/common/include/bifscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.566985561 -0700
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 #if ! defined(yyFlexLexerOnce)
 #undef yyFlexLexer
 #define yyFlexLexer bifFlexLexer
-#include "../win_include/FlexLexer.h"
+#include <FlexLexer.h>
 #endif
 
 // Override the interface for yylex since we namespaced it
diff -ruN a/common/include/cmdoptionsscanner.h b/common/include/cmdoptionsscanner.h
--- a/common/include/cmdoptionsscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.561240389 -0700
+++ b/common/include/cmdoptionsscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.567117683 -0700
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
 
 #undef yyFlexLexer
 #define yyFlexLexer reginitFlexLexer
-#include "../win_include/FlexLexer.h"
+#include <FlexLexer.h>
 #endif
 
 // Override the interface for yylex since we namespaced it
diff -ruN a/common/include/reginitscanner.h b/common/include/reginitscanner.h
--- a/common/include/reginitscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.564414916 -0700
+++ b/common/include/reginitscanner.h	2026-10-28 16:53:33.567152202 -0700
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
 
 #undef yyFlexLexer
 #define yyFlexLexer reginitFlexLexer
-#include "../win_include/FlexLexer.h"
+#include <FlexLexer.h>
 #endif
 
 // Override the interface for yylex since we namespaced it
diff -ruN a/parser/bif.y b/parser/bif.y
--- a/parser/bif.y	2026-10-28 16:53:33.553198548 -0700
+++ b/parser/bif.y	2026-10-28 16:53:33.566159870 -0700
